@startuml agentic-organization-agent-boundary
title Agentic Organization / Agent Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 6

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agent" as A
class "Agentic Organization" as AO

A --> AO : may operate within

note right
  Per ADR-ES-020 section 6 + AORG-NEG-001 + AORG-NEG-009:
  - Agentic Organization is NOT an Agent
  - An Agent is NOT an Agentic Organization
  - An Organization does NOT become Agentic merely because it contains an Agent
end note

@enduml
